{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About the Game</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickeat Catch is a fun stealth action catching game where you catch Chickeats, a special breed of chicken, and ship them off to pay off your debt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Niwa, got stuck with a big debt after their family\u2019s chicken farm went bust.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Niwa catch those Chickeats and clear that debt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/b9f8a7c113c539e3e2dc2070c5af93e0.poster.avif?t=1768408261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/b9f8a7c113c539e3e2dc2070c5af93e0.webm?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/b9f8a7c113c539e3e2dc2070c5af93e0.mp4?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Catching</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickeats are jumpy little birds, and they\u2019ll run off the moment they see you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak up behind them and grab them before they escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t feel bad about those slow Chickeats \u2014 they\u2019re easy pickings! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/900c10c3cfc4c8ce292591c3c5bfa82e.poster.avif?t=1768408261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/900c10c3cfc4c8ce292591c3c5bfa82e.webm?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/900c10c3cfc4c8ce292591c3c5bfa82e.mp4?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Shipping</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve caught your Chickeats, you can ship them off from the farm.  <br>Use the money from shipping to pay down that debt!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if they give you sad eyes, no need to hold back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/4d96a15a697cc15700414ecfaaf6d172.poster.avif?t=1768408261\" width=640 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/4d96a15a697cc15700414ecfaaf6d172.webm?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/4d96a15a697cc15700414ecfaaf6d172.mp4?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Farm</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you catch a Chickeat, it gets sent to your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickeats on the farm won\u2019t run away, even if they see you, so you can get a good close-up look at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can catch as many as you want, so feel free to send 1,000 Chickeats to the farm\u2014<br>as long as your PC doesn't crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/b216efdba49803497d58a1ebb22a0025.avif?t=1768408261\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras_big/b216efdba49803497d58a1ebb22a0025.avif?t=1768408261 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Different Types of Chickeats</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 25 kinds of Chickeats (for now).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has its own level of caution, speed, and price.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are rare, so be on the lookout for those special ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/3a5a6dd8be224110a7f0e0d9f6afba29.avif?t=1768408261\" width=640 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>5 Maps to Explore</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the story, you\u2019ll unlock new maps to explore.  <br>Chickeats live all over the world, and the types you\u2019ll find vary by location.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every corner to discover all the Chickeats out there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/9577df93ff93d5360129bfbb0acb0943.avif?t=1768408261\" width=640 height=300 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Challenge Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/560b2f7ce2713c15614ea24d682246aafd16ade8.jpg"},{"name":"Chickeat Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/6940cb8e5b15b949d3e99dfb9e91c39dfcc1f210.jpg"},{"name":"Got The Hang Of It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/df4cbfb1d129e4d33b08320884515b9ade5bbc42.jpg"},{"name":"Mid Tier Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/7ef3ed2cb23ca25b642daf1dae28c3f8347a7804.jpg"},{"name":"Capture Artisan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/3050cdf754abd30ed26544456a2b903cb0634b5a.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Entrance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/a5586319983c323bc4e9d63d14b8f3c70bd8df15.jpg"},{"name":"Chickeat Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/acba109eafde251b71431e76861745423090dec8.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie No More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/e083cc4187f42283281e766361a0b8754e3d2e10.jpg"},{"name":"Plains Pathfinder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/c1cc9e6cbb6e6b5e0db3301131c39e5315f11386.jpg"},{"name":"Forest Forager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216300/f6d5347038b8eaa4d6ac5602503348e8bad0921d.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216300?t=1768408261","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216300?t=1768408261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/a9d53dcc869c62b4ad7704a288e4725271c8f5f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768408261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/a9d53dcc869c62b4ad7704a288e4725271c8f5f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768408261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About the Game</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickeat Catch is a fun stealth action catching game where you catch Chickeats, a special breed of chicken, and ship them off to pay off your debt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, Niwa, got stuck with a big debt after their family\u2019s chicken farm went bust.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Niwa catch those Chickeats and clear that debt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/b9f8a7c113c539e3e2dc2070c5af93e0.poster.avif?t=1768408261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/b9f8a7c113c539e3e2dc2070c5af93e0.webm?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/b9f8a7c113c539e3e2dc2070c5af93e0.mp4?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Catching</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickeats are jumpy little birds, and they\u2019ll run off the moment they see you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak up behind them and grab them before they escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t feel bad about those slow Chickeats \u2014 they\u2019re easy pickings! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/900c10c3cfc4c8ce292591c3c5bfa82e.poster.avif?t=1768408261\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/900c10c3cfc4c8ce292591c3c5bfa82e.webm?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/900c10c3cfc4c8ce292591c3c5bfa82e.mp4?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Shipping</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve caught your Chickeats, you can ship them off from the farm.  <br>Use the money from shipping to pay down that debt!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if they give you sad eyes, no need to hold back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/4d96a15a697cc15700414ecfaaf6d172.poster.avif?t=1768408261\" width=640 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/4d96a15a697cc15700414ecfaaf6d172.webm?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/4d96a15a697cc15700414ecfaaf6d172.mp4?t=1768408261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Farm</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you catch a Chickeat, it gets sent to your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chickeats on the farm won\u2019t run away, even if they see you, so you can get a good close-up look at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can catch as many as you want, so feel free to send 1,000 Chickeats to the farm\u2014<br>as long as your PC doesn't crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/b216efdba49803497d58a1ebb22a0025.avif?t=1768408261\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras_big/b216efdba49803497d58a1ebb22a0025.avif?t=1768408261 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Different Types of Chickeats</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 25 kinds of Chickeats (for now).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has its own level of caution, speed, and price.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are rare, so be on the lookout for those special ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/3a5a6dd8be224110a7f0e0d9f6afba29.avif?t=1768408261\" width=640 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>5 Maps to Explore</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the story, you\u2019ll unlock new maps to explore.  <br>Chickeats live all over the world, and the types you\u2019ll find vary by location.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every corner to discover all the Chickeats out there! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/extras/9577df93ff93d5360129bfbb0acb0943.avif?t=1768408261\" width=640 height=300 /></span></p>","developers":["Yamei Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216300/header.jpg?t=1768408261","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30a4\u30f3\u30c6\u30ebCore M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB 2400 MHz DDR4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 555X 4 GB In